PS+=['Jeans are very popular. Almost everyone has at least one pair of jeans. Jacob W. Davis and Levi Strauss first made them for workers in the late 1850s. From 1960, jeans became popular with young people. People usually have more than one pair of jeans now. There are so many different kinds of jeans. Let’s take a look at some of them.\n【STRAIGHT JEANS】Straight jeans are the same size from the top to the ankle part. They are classical and fit most body types. If you never try jeans, they should be your first choice.\n【FLARED JEANS】Flared jeans started getting popular in the 1970s. They become wider from the knees down, and the pant legs are in a “bell-like” shape. They make people look taller.\n【BOYFRIEND JEANS】People started calling these boyfriend jeans because of how they look when a woman wears them! It is like she’s wearing her boyfriend’s big and loose jeans. So, these are the type of comfortable pants.\n【SKINNY JEANS】Skinny jeans are so different from boyfriend jeans. As the name says, skinny jeans fit your legs. If you have long and straight legs, 【these】 are just for you! On the other hand, people with round body shapes should not wear them.\n（ankle 腳踝　classical 經典的　fit 合身　loose 鬆的）']
